14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,@May Stop joking around! We need to be serious. Who do you suspect is the wolf?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minato,,I don’t know who the wolf is yet. I just want to be nice to everyone. Maybe we can all share our feelings?,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
